      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 151, 153, 154]\n    volumes = [200, 220, 210, 230, 240]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    obv = [0]\n    for i in range(1, len(closing_prices)):\n        if closing_prices[i] > closing_prices[i - 1]:\n            obv.append(obv[-1] + volumes[i])\n        elif closing_prices[i] < closing_prices[i - 1]:\n            obv.append(obv[-1] - volumes[i])\n        else:\n            obv.append(obv[-1])\n\n    answer = obv[-1]\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
